= The Merchant Corps Uprising

Days ago, Chiang Kai-shek's ship *Jianggu* had detained a British vessel full of weapons and ammunition purchased by the Cantonese Merchant Corps. Sun Yat-sen has in exchange, issued arrest warrants for the Merchant Corps.
Now, the Merchant Corps under Chen Lianbo have begun a strike throughout the city of Canton. Multiple counties have also joined the strike. They have begun demanding that Sun's government resign and have begun setting up defenses in the Xiguan region of Canton.

- @next: Sun Yat-sen flees the city!

@next
on-arrival: guangdong_governor = "Hu Hanmin"; old_middle_kmt -= 5; new_middle_kmt -= 5;

Sun Yat-sen has left for Shaoguan. Hu Hanmin has been chosen as the new Governor of Guangdong in his place. The crisis deepens as the Merchant Corps take up arms.
